  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the iron teppan skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add olive oil to the preheated skillet and swirl it around.",
    "Add the sliced portuguese sausage to the skillet and cook until browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped onion, bell pepper, and tomato to the skillet and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the chicken broth, lemon juice, paprika, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the fresh uni to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the hot molten Portuguese uni skillet immediately."
